␀␀␀À!÷À!ø␀À"H†ğÀ"¾o/// A `MemoryUsage` object provides heap usage information for a specific
/// isolate at a given point in time.␀À&SV␀À&SÀ&^␀À&eÀ&k␀␀À&}À&ƒ␀␀À&”À&š␀␀␀À&­€×À&¸À&¹À&Â␀À&ÃÀ&Ù␀␀À&àÀ&åÀ&æÀ&ïÀ&ôÀ&ğÀ#TÉÀ%ª/// The amount of non-Dart memory that is retained by Dart objects. For
